&lt;p&gt;From: Eva Resterson, To: Bessie Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Printing Info: Bamforth &amp;amp; CO., New York&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bessie Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Ill&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From Ma&lt;br&gt;
Dear Bessie,&lt;br&gt;
Just received your card and was glad to hear from Pa. Fredda and I are not very good friends. I was down to Virginia Saturday afternoon and wished for you. V.C said hello.&lt;br&gt;
Eva Resterson&lt;/p&gt;</description>
